			description: [
				"The alloy smelting furnace will produce fluid (the corresponding product can be produced through the mixer-electric blast furnace or carbon disulfide) and molten fluid. The molten fluid needs to be cooled using a vacuum freezer"
				""
				"Don't be put off by the long smelting time, this is a result of integrating the blender's recipe directly into the smelting recipe, and is actually less time consuming than blending and then smelting the powder in a blast furnace (like stainless steel)."
