		{
			dependencies: ["27BA6EBA81622516"]
			description: [
				"To put it simply, it is to let the machine take items directly from the ME network and use them."
				""
				"Use&dflash memory&rto save the warehouse configuration and right-click to apply the configuration."
				""
				"&6automatic pull mode&rcan be turned on to automatically pull inventory items/fluids in the network (&btag bus can set pull sorting mode &r)"
				""
				"Use the&dwire cutter&rto right-click the ME warehouse to switch the ME warehouse between networking from the front and networking from any side."
				""
				"The&6pull interval&rcan be adjusted in the lower left corner of the warehouse gui. The default display is 0tick, which means the pull interval is not changed.&bis the minimum 1tick&r(affects the speed of pulling from the ME network)"
				""
				"The&dextreme pull mode&rcan be turned on in the gtlcore configuration file, so that the&6ME inventory input assembly&rpull will no longer have a delay (affects parallel computing), but may have a certain impact on TPS"
				""
				"The tag inventory bus is used in the same way as the tag storage bus"
